Sporeline is a separate program, but its design comes from mycolog by
Richard Ulmer: https://github.com/codesoap/mycolog

Borrowed by design, not by code — no mycolog source is included here.
What was taken: the four component kinds (spores, mycelium, spawn,
grows), marking things "gone" instead of deleting them, the rule for
which relatives appear in a family tree, renaming a species across an
entire family, and the label alphabet that omits I, O and 0.

